        "title": "点: Express decimals with 点",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "点 separates a decimal's integer part from its decimal digits. Read digits after 点 individually, not as an ordinary multi-digit number.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "三点一四。",
                "pinyin": "sān diǎn yī sì 。",
                "meaning": "Three point one four.",
